<title>USA: CCC buys 19,860 T US wheat for Ethiopia, Pakistan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 19,860 T US wheat for Ethiopia, Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The USDA's Commodity Credit Corporation purchased on September 11 a total of 19,860 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat for export distribution to Ethiopia amd Pakistan.</p>
<p>Shipment is scheduled for September 25-October 20.</p>
<p>CCC bought 10,000 tonnes at $185.45 a tonne and 9,860 tonnes at $186.21 a tonne from United Grain Growers.</p>
<p>Out of the total, 4,520 tonnes was bound for Pakistan and 15,340 tonnes went to Ethiopia.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
